<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KLAIVE — Just send it. The system handles the rest.</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --teal: #1D9E75;
            --teal-deep: #0F6E56;
            --teal-light: #E1F5EE;
            --black: #0E0E0E;
            --surface: #1A1A1A;
            --surface2: #222222;
            --border: #2A2A2A;
            --text: #F5F5F3;
            --text2: #888780;
            --text3: #444441;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--black); color: var(--text); }
        .grotesk { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; }
        .teal { color: var(--teal); }

        /* Symbol SVG animation */
        .symbol-dash {
            stroke-dasharray: 7 6;
            animation: dash-move 3s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes dash-move {
            to { stroke-dashoffset: -52; }
        }

        /* Nav */
        nav {
            border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            background: rgba(14,14,14,0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50;
        }
        .nav-inner {
            max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 32px; height: 60px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .nav-logo {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .nav-logo span {
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 4px; color: var(--text);
        }
        .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; }
        .nav-links a {
            font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2);
            text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.15s;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
        .nav-cta {
            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
            background: var(--teal); color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 7px 18px; border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--teal-deep); color: #ffffff !important; }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
            max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 100px 32px 80px;
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 80px; align-items: center;
        }
        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(29,158,117,0.08);
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(29,158,117,0.2);
            border-radius: 100px; padding: 4px 12px;
            font-size: 11px; color: var(--teal);
            letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 52px; font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -1px;
            color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .hero h1 em {
            font-style: normal; color: var(--teal);
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 15px; color: var(--text2);
            line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 36px;
            max-width: 480px;
        }
        .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--teal); color: #fff;
            padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--teal-deep); }
        .btn-ghost {
            background: transparent;
            border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--text2);
            padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;
            transition: border-color 0.15s, color 0.15s;
        }
        .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--teal); color: var(--teal); }

        /* Dashboard mockup — partial view */
        .dash-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 14px 0 0 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            max-height: 380px;
        }
        .dash-wrapper::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 160px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--black));
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .dash-wrapper::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            width: 120px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--black));
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .dash-frame {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .dash-topbar {
            padding: 10px 16px;
            border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            display: flex; align-items: center;
            background: var(--surface2);
        }
        .dash-topbar .dot-row { display: flex; gap: 5px; }
        .dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; }
        .dash-body {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 160px;
        }
        .dash-cal {
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border-right: 0.5px solid var(--border);
        }
        .cal-nav-row {
            display: flex; align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .cal-nav-row span { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); }
        .cal-nav-row .arr { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text2); }
        .cal-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
            gap: 1px; font-size: 9px;
        }
        .cal-dl { color: var(--text2); text-align: center; padding: 2px 0; }
        .cal-d { color: var(--text2); text-align: center; padding: 3px 1px; min-height: 44px; }
        .cal-d .dn { margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .cal-d.today .dn {
            background: var(--teal); color: #fff;
            border-radius: 50%; width: 16px; height: 16px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 2px; font-size: 8px;
        }
        .ev {
            font-size: 7px; border-radius: 2px;
            padding: 1px 2px; margin-bottom: 1px;
            white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }
        .ev-blue { background: rgba(28,126,214,0.15); color: #85B7EB; }
        .ev-teal { background: rgba(29,158,117,0.15); color: #5DCAA5; }
        .ev-gray { background: rgba(136,135,128,0.15); color: var(--text2); }
        .dash-right {
            padding: 10px;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
        }
        .msg-box {
            background: var(--surface2);
            border-radius: 7px; padding: 8px;
        }
        .msg-label {
            font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--text2); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .msg-input {
            width: 100%; background: var(--black);
            border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 5px; padding: 5px 7px;
            font-size: 8px; color: var(--text2);
            height: 40px; resize: none;
        }
        .msg-send {
            margin-top: 4px; width: 100%;
            background: var(--teal); color: #fff;
            border: none; border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 8px; padding: 4px; cursor: pointer;
        }
        .ov-label {
            font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--text2); text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .ov-card {
            border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 7px; padding: 8px;
            background: var(--black);
        }
        .ov-card-head {
            display: flex; align-items: center;
            gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .ov-card-icon { font-size: 9px; color: var(--text2); }
        .ov-card-title {
            font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text2);
        }
        .ov-val { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); line-height: 1; }
        .ov-sub { font-size: 8px; color: var(--text2); margin-top: 1px; }
        .ov-bar { height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--border); margin-top: 5px; overflow: hidden; }
        .ov-bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; }
        .ov-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 3px; }
        .ov-row span { font-size: 7px; color: var(--text2); }
        .task-row {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
            padding: 2px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
        }
        .task-row:last-child { border: none; }
        .task-check {
            width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px;
            border: 0.5px solid var(--border); flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .task-check.done { background: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); }
        .task-text { font-size: 8px; color: var(--text2); }
        .task-text.done { text-decoration: line-through; opacity: 0.4; }

        /* Flow section */
        .flow-section {
            max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 100px 32px;
        }
        .section-eyebrow {
            font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: var(--teal); text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .flow-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1px; margin-top: 48px;
            border: 0.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .flow-step {
            background: var(--surface); padding: 28px 24px;
            border-right: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            position: relative;
        }
        .flow-step:last-child { border-right: none; }
        .flow-num {
            font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--teal); margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .flow-title {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .flow-desc {
            font-size: 12px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.65;
        }
        .flow-arrow {
            position: absolute; right: -10px; top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 20px; height: 20px;
            background: var(--surface2); border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center;
            justify-content: center; z-index: 1;
            font-size: 9px; color: var(--teal);
        }

        /* Features */
        .features-section {
            border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            padding: 100px 0;
        }
        .features-inner {
            max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px;
        }
        .features-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1px; margin-top: 48px;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: var(--surface); padding: 36px 28px;
            border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            transition: border-color 0.2s;
        }
        .feature-card:first-child { border-radius: 12px 0 0 12px; }
        .feature-card:last-child { border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; }
        .feature-card:hover { border-color: rgba(29,158,117,0.3); }
        .feature-icon {
            width: 36px; height: 36px;
            background: rgba(29,158,117,0.08);
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(29,158,117,0.2);
            border-radius: 8px; display: flex;
            align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .feature-title {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .feature-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.7; }

        /* Philosophy */
        .philosophy-section {
            border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            padding: 100px 32px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .philosophy-inner { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .philosophy-quote {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px; font-weight: 300;
            color: var(--text); line-height: 1.35;
            margin: 24px 0 20px; letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .philosophy-quote em { font-style: normal; color: var(--teal); }

        /* Subscribe */
        .subscribe-section {
            border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            padding: 100px 32px; text-align: center;
        }
        .subscribe-inner { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .subscribe-form {
            display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 32px;
        }
        .subscribe-input {
            flex: 1; background: var(--surface);
            border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px; padding: 11px 16px;
            font-size: 13px; color: var(--text);
            outline: none; transition: border-color 0.15s;
        }
        .subscribe-input:focus { border-color: var(--teal); }
        .subscribe-input::placeholder { color: var(--text2); }
        .subscribe-btn {
            background: var(--teal); color: #fff;
            border: none; border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 11px 22px; font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.15s; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .subscribe-btn:hover { background: var(--teal-deep); }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            padding: 40px 32px;
        }
        .footer-inner {
            max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex; align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .footer-logo {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        }
        .footer-logo span {
            font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--text2);
        }
        .footer-right { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; padding: 60px 20px; }
            .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }
            .flow-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .feature-card:first-child { border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0; }
            .feature-card:last-child { border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px; }
            .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }
            .subscribe-form { flex-direction: column; }
        }
    </style>
    <style>
        /* ===== Refreshed sections (positioning v2) ===== */
        .wrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
        .section-eyebrow {
            font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--teal); margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .sec { padding: 96px 0; border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border); }
        .sec h2 {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 34px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            line-height: 1.2; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 18px; max-width: 640px;
        }
        .sec .lead { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.75; max-width: 560px; margin-bottom: 0; }
        /* Problem */
        .prob-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px; margin-top: 44px; }
        .prob-card {
            background: var(--surface); border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px;
        }
        .prob-card h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .prob-card p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.7; }
        /* Pipeline */
        .pipe { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0; margin-top: 48px; }
        .pipe-step { position: relative; padding-right: 28px; }
        .pipe-num { font-size: 11px; color: var(--teal); letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .pipe-step h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .pipe-step p { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.65; }
        .pipe-step:not(:last-child)::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: 4px; right: 12px; width: 0.5px; height: 90%;
            background: var(--border);
        }
        /* Data ownership */
        .own { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; margin-top: 44px; }
        .own-points { list-style: none; }
        .own-points li { display: flex; gap: 14px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border); }
        .own-points li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .own-ic {
            flex-shrink: 0; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px;
            background: rgba(29,158,117,0.1); color: var(--teal);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px;
        }
        .own-points strong { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 3px; }
        .own-points span { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.6; }
        .drive-card {
            background: var(--surface); border: 0.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 26px; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        }
        .drive-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border); font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); }
        .drive-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .drive-row .ext { margin-left: auto; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); }
        .drive-foot { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.6; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        /* Digest */
        .digest { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; margin-top: 44px; align-items: start; }
        .phone {
            background: var(--surface); border: 0.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 22px; max-width: 360px;
        }
        .phone-label { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .bubble {
            background: var(--surface2); border-radius: 14px 14px 14px 4px;
            padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 280px;
        }
        .bubble-time { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text2); margin-top: 8px; }
        .mail {
            background: var(--surface); border: 0.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px;
        }
        .mail-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .mail-subj { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); }
        .mail-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); }
        .mail-line { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.7; padding: 4px 0; }
        .mail-line b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
        /* Why KLAIVE */
        .why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 44px; }
        .why-card { padding: 28px; background: var(--surface); border: 0.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; }
        .why-card .why-ic {
            width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 9px; background: rgba(29,158,117,0.1);
            color: var(--teal); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .why-card h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .why-card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.7; }
        /* CTA */
        .cta { text-align: center; padding: 110px 0; border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border); }
        .cta h2 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .cta p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .pron { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); letter-spacing: 1px; }
        @media (max-width: 760px) {
            .prob-grid, .own, .digest, .why-grid, .pipe { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
            .pipe-step::after { display: none; }
            .sec h2 { font-size: 27px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
    <div class="nav-inner">
        <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none">
                <defs><clipPath id="navClip"><path d="M 60 16 A 44 44 0 1 1 16 60 L 60 60 Z"/></clipPath></defs>
                <g clip-path="url(#navClip)"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="44" fill="none" stroke="#F5F5F3" stroke-width="5"/></g>
                <line x1="60" y1="60" x2="60" y2="104" stroke="#F5F5F3" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <line x1="16" y1="60" x2="60" y2="60" stroke="#F5F5F3" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M 16 60 A 44 44 0 0 1 60 16" fill="none" stroke="#F5F5F3" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="7 6" stroke-linecap="round" class="symbol-dash"/>
                <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="7" fill="#1D9E75"/>
            </svg>
            <span>KLAIVE</span>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#problem">Why</a>
            <a href="#flow">How it works</a>
            <a href="#data">Your data</a>
            <a href="signup.html" class="nav-cta">Get started</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<header>
    <div class="hero">
        <div>
            <div class="hero-badge">
                <span style="width:5px;height:5px;background:var(--teal);border-radius:50%;"></span>
                YOUR MESSAGES, ORGANIZED
            </div>
            <h1>Just send it.<br><em>The system<br>handles the rest.</em></h1>
            <p>Text anything — a date, an amount, a note. KLAIVE reads it, files it where it belongs, and keeps it in your own Google Drive. Yours to keep, even if KLAIVE disappears.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="signup.html" class="btn-primary">Start your free trial</a>
                <a href="#flow" class="btn-ghost">See how it works</a>
